  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> in a solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>, respectively. Molar solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;in the same solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> (expressed in scientific notation). The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> is<br />[Given: Solubility product of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math>. For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is very large and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>]</p><p>If the numerical value has more than two decimal places, truncate/round-off the value to TWO decimal places.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><munder><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></munder></mtd><mtd><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>&nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></math>&nbsp;is very large)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mover><mo>&#8652;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced></math> coming from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Rather than dissociation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math>&nbsp;into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> ions, association between already present <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> will take place.</p><p>Assuming &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&#39; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>combines to form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>HSO</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;(assuming&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>If solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>sM</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Pb</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msubsup><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>(assuming <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#8810;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>On comparing with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}